  "title": "Alphabetic Decision Task (Arial Light Font)",
  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG recordings from an alphabetic decision task using Arial Light font, collected to investigate sub-letter orthographic processing through optimal transport modeling. Participants performed a letter discrimination task while EEG data were recorded and synchronized with behavioral responses and stimulus information. The dataset includes 6 participants with detailed annotations of recording issues and data quality markers.",
  "methods_description": "EEG data were recorded during an alphabetic decision task and processed using MNE-BIDS. Data were synchronized with behavioral responses, stimulus information, and metadata. Recording issues including interrupted sessions and channel wiring corrections are documented and corrected in the BIDS version.",
